text: ["({R/G} can be paid with either {R} or {G}.)\nTrample; haste; shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life.\nAll creatures get -X/-X until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a green creature.\nSearch your library for a green creature card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "As long as Winter Orb is untapped, players can't untap more than one land during their untap steps.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Sulfuric Vortex deals 2 damage to that player.\nIf a player would gain life, that player gains no life instead.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player sacrifices an artifact, creature, or land.", 'At the beginning of your draw step, you may draw two additional cards. If you do, choose two cards in your hand drawn this turn. For each of those cards, pay 4 life or put the card on top of your library.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Honden of Infinite Rage deals damage to any target equal to the number of Shrines you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, create a 1/1 colorless Spirit creature token for each Shrine you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, draw a card for each Shrine you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, flip a coin. If you lose the flip, Mana Crypt deals 3 damage to you.\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, target opponent discards a card for each Shrine you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you gain 2 life for each Shrine you control.', 'Attacking creatures you control get +1/+0.', 'Bloodfell Caves enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Bloodfell Caves enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Blossoming Sands enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Blossoming Sands enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Carbonize deals 3 damage to any target. If it's a creature, it can't be regenerated this turn, and if it would die this turn, exile it instead.", "Carrion Feeder can't block.\nSacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Carrion Feeder.", 'Cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)', "Chain Lightning deals 3 damage to any target. Then that player or that permanent's controller may pay {R}{R}. If the player does, they may copy this spell and may choose a new target for that copy.", 'Choose a nonland card name. Target player reveals their hand and discards all cards with that name.\nFlashback—Sacrifice a creature. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Choose a number. Destroy all artifacts and creatures with mana value equal to that number. Then target player reveals their hand and discards all nonland cards with mana value equal to the number.', "Choose one —\n• Counter target spell if it's blue.\n• Destroy target permanent if it's blue.", "Choose one —\n• Counter target spell if it's red.\n• Destroy target permanent if it's red.", 'Choose two target creature cards in your graveyard. Sacrifice a creature. If you do, return the chosen cards to the battlefield tapped.', 'Counter target spell.', "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, put it on top of its owner's library instead of into that player's graveyard.", 'Create a 5/5 blue Wall creature token with defender. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Create a 5/5 blue and red Elemental creature token with flying.\nRetrace (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a land card in addition to paying its other costs.)', 'Create a 6/6 green Wurm creature token.\nFlashback {3}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Creature tokens you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.', "Creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.\nFlashback {2}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Creatures you control have haste.\nCascade, cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order. Then do it again.)', 'Defender\nWhen Dragon Egg dies, create a 2/2 red Dragon creature token with flying and "{R}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'Defender\nWhen Wall of Omens enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. Its controller gains 4 life.', 'Destroy target land.', 'Destroy target non-Elf creature.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.\nDraw a card.", 'Destroy target permanent.', 'Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Draw two cards, then discard a card at random.\nFlashback {2}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Draw two cards, then discard two cards.\nFlashback {2}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Each player chooses a number of lands they control equal to the number of lands controlled by the player who controls the fewest, then sacrifices the rest. Players discard cards and sacrifice creatures the same way.', 'Each player mills two cards. Then you put a creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Each player sacrifices a creature.', 'Each player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library. You exile the top ten cards of your library. Then each player draws up to seven cards.', 'Echo {1}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Mogg War Marshal enters the battlefield or dies, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token.', 'Echo {2}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Ghitu Slinger enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Echo {3} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nSacrifice Ticking Gnomes: It deals 1 damage to any target.', "Echo {3}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Stingscourger enters the battlefield, return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", 'Echo {4}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Crater Hellion enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to each other creature.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.\nWhen Undying Rage is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Undying Rage to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has trample.\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 for each other enchantment on the battlefield.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\nWhen enchanted creature dies, create a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'Enchant creature\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by enchanted creature.', "Enchant creature\nWhen Stupefying Touch enters the battlefield, draw a card.\nEnchanted creature's activated abilities can't be activated.", 'Enchant creature\nYou control enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature card in a graveyard\nWhen Animate Dead enters the battlefield, if it\'s on the battlefield, it loses "enchant creature card in a graveyard" and gains "enchant creature put onto the battlefield with Animate Dead." Return enchanted creature card to the battlefield under your control and attach Animate Dead to it. When Animate Dead leaves the battlefield, that creature\'s controller sacrifices it.\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-0.', "Enchant creature without flying\nWhen Roots enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant land\nWhen Abundant Growth enters the battlefield, draw a card.\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', "Enchant permanent\nWhen Faith's Fetters enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.\nEnchanted permanent can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated unless they're mana abilities.", 'Exile target attacking creature.\nDraw a card.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', 'Firebolt deals 2 damage to any target.\nFlashback {4}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'First strike\nBallynock Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another white creature.', "First strike\nWhen Nekrataal enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. That creature can't be regenerated.", 'Flame Jab deals 1 damage to any target.\nRetrace (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a land card in addition to paying its other costs.)', 'Flash\nWhen Dualcaster Mage enters the battlefield, copy target instant or sorcery spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', "Flash\nWhen Whitemane Lion enters the battlefield, return a creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nFlying\nOther creatures you control with flying get +1/+1.', 'Flinthoof Boar gets +1/+1 as long as you control a Mountain.\n{R}: Flinthoof Boar gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Flying', 'Flying\nAs long as Wonder is in your graveyard and you control an Island, creatures you control have flying.', 'Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, Serendib Efreet deals 1 damage to you.', "Flying\nBattle Squadron's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.", 'Flying\nCreature spells with flying you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Flying\nIslandcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for an Island card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Flying\nOther creatures you control with flying get +0/+1.\n{T}: Other creatures you control with flying get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nVanishing 3 (This creature enters the battlefield with three time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter from it. When the last is removed, sacrifice it.)\nWhen Aven Riftwatcher enters or leaves the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Havoc Demon dies, all creatures get -5/-5 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhen Peregrine Drake enters the battlefield, untap up to five lands.', "Flying\nWhen Pilgrim's Eye enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", 'Flying\nWhen Skulking Ghost becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it.', 'Flying\nWhen Squadron Hawk enters the battlefield, you may search your library for up to three cards named Squadron Hawk, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Flying\nWhen Welkin Guide enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', "Flying\nWhenever Brago, King Eternal deals combat damage to a player, exile any number of target nonland permanents you control, then return those cards to the battlefield under their owner's control.", 'Flying\nWhenever Jetting Glasskite becomes the target of a spell or ability for the first time each turn, counter that spell or ability.', 'Flying\nWhenever Trygon Predator deals combat damage to a player, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment that player controls.', "Flying\nWhenever Xantid Swarm attacks, defending player can't cast spells this turn.", 'Flying\nWhenever a creature with flying dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Soulcatcher.', 'Flying\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Wee Dragonauts gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Regenerate Wake of Vultures.', "Flying\n{T}: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Flying, deathtouch\nWhen Baleful Strix enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Flying, first strike, vigilance, lifelink, protection from red and from green', 'Flying, haste', 'Flying, protection from black\nEcho {3}{W}{W} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Karmic Guide enters the battlefield, return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Flying, trample\nWhen Worldgorger Dragon enters the battlefield, exile all other permanents you control.\nWhen Worldgorger Dragon leaves the battlefield, return the exiled cards to the battlefield under their owners' control.", 'Flying, vigilance', "Giant Tortoise gets +0/+3 as long as it's untapped.", 'Haste\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Ichorid.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if Ichorid is in your graveyard, you may exile a black creature card other than Ichorid from your graveyard. If you do, return Ichorid to the battlefield.', 'Haste\nCascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)', 'Haste\nEcho {2}{R}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Keldon Champion enters the battlefield, it deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Haste\nThreshold — As long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard, Centaur Chieftain has "When Centaur Chieftain enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain trample until end of turn."', 'Haste\nWhen Avarax enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a card named Avarax, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\n{1}{R}: Avarax gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Haste\nWhen Fervent Cathar enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.", "If you control a Forest, rather than pay this spell's mana cost, you may have an opponent gain 3 life.\nTarget creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.", "Imprint — When Chrome Mox enters the battlefield, you may exile a nonartifact, nonland card from your hand.\n{T}: Add one mana of any of the exiled card's colors.", "Imprint — When Duplicant enters the battlefield, you may exile target nontoken creature.\nAs long as a card exiled with Duplicant is a creature card, Duplicant has the power, toughness, and creature types of the last creature card exiled with Duplicant. It's still a Shapeshifter.", 'Imprint — When Isochron Scepter enters the battlefield, you may exile an instant card with mana value 2 or less from your hand.\n{2}, {T}: You may copy the exiled card. If you do, you may cast the copy without paying its mana cost.', "Imprint — When Phyrexian Ingester enters the battlefield, you may exile target nontoken creature.\nPhyrexian Ingester gets +X/+Y, where X is the exiled creature card's power and Y is its toughness.", "Juggernaut attacks each combat if able.\nJuggernaut can't be blocked by Walls.", 'Jungle Hollow enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Jungle Hollow enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.', 'Kird Ape gets +1/+2 as long as you control a Forest.', 'Mindless Automaton enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}, Discard a card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mindless Automaton.\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Mindless Automaton: Draw a card.', 'Morbid — When Wakedancer enters the battlefield, if a creature died this turn, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Morbid — When you cast this spell, if a creature died this turn, you may copy Malicious Affliction and may choose a new target for the copy.\nDestroy target nonblack creature.', "Nevinyrral's Disk enters the battlefield tapped.\n{1}, {T}: Destroy all artifacts, creatures, and enchantments.", 'Other Elves you control get +1/+1.\n{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'Play with the top card of your library revealed.\nYou may play lands and cast spells from the top of your library.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Price of Progress deals damage to each player equal to twice the number of nonbasic lands that player controls.', 'Protection from white\n{1}{R}: Wildfire Emissary gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Put target nonland permanent into its owner's library just beneath the top X cards of that library.", 'Reach, deathtouch', "Return an Elf you control to its owner's hand: Untap target creature. Activate only once each turn.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\nFlashback {4}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)", 'Return up to one target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield if {B} was spent to cast this spell. Creatures target player controls get +2/+0 and gain haste until end of turn if {R} was spent to cast this spell. (Do both if {B}{R} was spent.)', 'Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.\nDraw a card.', 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. You may put a creature or enchantment card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', 'Rugged Highlands enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Rugged Highlands enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Sacrifice Benevolent Bodyguard: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice Mogg Fanatic: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice Seal of Cleansing: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Sacrifice Seal of Strength: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Add {C}{C}.', 'Sacrifice two creatures: Create a 3/1 red Beast creature token named Carnivore.', 'Scoured Barrens enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Scoured Barrens enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', "Search target player's library for up to three cards with flashback and put them into that player's graveyard. Then the player shuffles.", 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your graveyard, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, discard a card at random, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top. You lose 2 life.', "Search your library for a green creature card with mana value X or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. Shuffle Green Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", 'Search your library for an artifact or enchantment card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', 'Search your library for an instant or sorcery card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nThreshold — Nimble Mongoose gets +2/+2 as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.", "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nVanishing 4 (This creature enters the battlefield with four time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter from it. When the last is removed, sacrifice it.)", "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\nWhenever you cast an enchantment spell, draw a card.", 'Skip your draw step.\nWhenever you discard a card, exile that card from your graveyard.\nPay 1 life: Exile the top card of your library face down. Put that card into your hand at the beginning of your next end step.', 'Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Tap target artifact or creature.', 'Tap three untapped Elves you control: Add {G}{G}{G}.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.\nFlashback {2}{G}{G} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains haste until end of turn.\nFlashback {2}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\nMorbid — That creature gets -13/-13 until end of turn instead if a creature died this turn.', 'Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.\nDraw a card.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards two cards at random.', 'Target player draws a card.\nRetrace (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a land card in addition to paying its other costs.)', 'Target player draws two cards.\nFlashback—{1}{U}, Pay 3 life. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target player mills three cards.\nFlashback {1}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Target player shuffles up to three target cards from their graveyard into their library.\nDraw a card.\nWhen Gaea's Blessing is put into your graveyard from your library, shuffle your graveyard into your library.", 'Thornwood Falls enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Thornwood Falls enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'Threshold — As long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard, Cephalid Sage has "When Cephalid Sage enters the battlefield, draw three cards, then discard two cards."', 'Trample\nAs long as Brawn is in your graveyard and you control a Forest, creatures you control have trample.', "Trample\nIslandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Trample\n{G}: Regenerate Silvos, Rogue Elemental.', 'Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Until end of turn, creatures you control get +1/+1 and creatures your opponents control get -1/-1.', 'Until end of turn, target creature loses all abilities and has base power and toughness 0/1.', 'Vanishing 2 (This creature enters the battlefield with two time counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter from it. When the last is removed, sacrifice it.)\nWhen Keldon Marauders enters or leaves the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Vigilance\nWhen Glimmerpoint Stag enters the battlefield, exile another target permanent. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Vigilance, reach', 'When Beetleback Chief enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'When Civic Wayfinder enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Deadbridge Shaman dies, target opponent discards a card.', 'When Flame-Kin Zealot enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain haste until end of turn.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Kor Hookmaster enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'When Monk Idealist enters the battlefield, return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Phyrexian Gargantua enters the battlefield, you draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', 'When Phyrexian Rager enters the battlefield, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'When Prowling Pangolin enters the battlefield, any player may sacrifice two creatures. If a player does, sacrifice Prowling Pangolin.', 'When Regal Force enters the battlefield, draw a card for each green creature you control.', 'When Screeching Skaab enters the battlefield, mill two cards.', 'When Sengir Autocrat enters the battlefield, create three 0/1 black Serf creature tokens.\nWhen Sengir Autocrat leaves the battlefield, exile all Serf tokens.', 'When Shaman of the Pack enters the battlefield, target opponent loses life equal to the number of Elves you control.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When War Priest of Thune enters the battlefield, you may destroy target enchantment.', 'When you control no other creatures, sacrifice Emperor Crocodile.', 'Whenever Blood Artist or another creature dies, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever Borderland Marauder attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Jareth, Leonine Titan blocks, it gets +7/+7 until end of turn.\n{W}: Jareth gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Whenever another Elf enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on Elvish Vanguard.', 'Whenever you cast a spell from your graveyard, Burning Vengeance deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Whenever you cast an Elf spell, you may create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 red Elemental creature token.', 'While an opponent is choosing targets as part of casting a spell they control or activating an ability they control, that player must choose at least one Flagbearer on the battlefield if able.', 'Wind-Scarred Crag enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Wind-Scarred Crag enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Worn Powerstone enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', 'Yavimaya Enchantress gets +1/+1 for each enchantment on the battlefield.', 'You draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', "You may exile a red card from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nPyrokinesis deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures.", "You may pay 1 life and exile a blue card from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nCounter target spell.", "You may return an Island you control to its owner's hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.", '[+1]: Target player draws two cards, then discards two cards.\n[−2]: Gain control of target artifact.\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a spell that targets one or more permanents, gain control of those permanents."', "[+2]: Look at the top card of target player's library. You may put that card on the bottom of that player's library.\n[0]: Draw three cards, then put two cards from your hand on top of your library in any order.\n[−1]: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\n[−12]: Exile all cards from target player's library, then that player shuffles their hand into their library.", "{1}: Look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order.\n{T}: Draw a card, then put Sensei's Divining Top on top of its owner's library.", '{1}{W}: Target permanent you control gains protection from white until end of turn.\n{1}: Target spell or permanent becomes white until end of turn.', '{2}, Sacrifice a land: Create two 1/1 red and white Goblin Soldier creature tokens.', '{3}, {T}: Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a land card. Goblin Charbelcher deals damage equal to the number of nonland cards revealed this way to any target. If the revealed land card was a Mountain, Goblin Charbelcher deals double that damage instead. Put the revealed cards on the bottom of your library in any order.', '{5}, {T}: Draw two cards, then discard a card.', '{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{R}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. That creature gains haste. Sacrifice the creature at the beginning of the next end step.', '{T}, Discard an Elf card: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves you control.', '{T}, Mill a card: Add {C}. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}: Mishra's Factory becomes a 2/2 Assembly-Worker artifact creature until end of turn. It's still a land.\n{T}: Target Assembly-Worker creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}, Sacrifice Wasteland: Destroy target nonbasic land.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {G}.\nThreshold — Werebear gets +3/+3 as long as seven or more cards are in your graveyard.', "{T}: Add {W}.\n{T}: Return target legendary creature to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', "{T}: Draw three cards.\n{2}{U}{U}: Return Arcanis the Omnipotent to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Exile target land card from a graveyard. Add one mana of any color.\n{B}, {T}: Exile target instant or sorcery card from a graveyard. Each opponent loses 2 life.\n{G}, {T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. You gain 2 life.', '{T}: Prodigal Sorcerer deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves on the battlefield.', '{T}: Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: Target player exiles a card from their graveyard.\n{1}, Exile Relic of Progenitus: Exile all graveyards. Draw a card.', '{T}: Untap target attacking creature. Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by that creature this turn.']
